## Commands Reference

```cisco
! CDP
cdp run                          ! Enable CDP globally
no cdp run                       ! Disable CDP globally
no cdp enable                    ! Disable CDP on an interface
show cdp neighbors               ! View CDP neighbors
show cdp neighbors detail        ! View detailed CDP neighbor info
show cdp interface               ! View CDP status per interface

! LLDP
lldp run                         ! Enable LLDP globally
lldp transmit                    ! Enable LLDP transmit on interface
no lldp transmit                 ! Disable LLDP transmit on interface
lldp receive                     ! Enable LLDP receive on interface
no lldp receive                  ! Disable LLDP receive on interface
show lldp                        ! View global LLDP status
show lldp neighbors              ! View LLDP neighbors

! NTP
ntp server <ip>                  ! Configure NTP server
show ntp status                  ! View NTP sync status
show ntp associations            ! View NTP peer associations
```

